    "updated_at": "2024-03-28T10:30:15Z",
    "body": "I don't think this works. Blobs cannot be read synchronously. I could maybe see this if we have a new API where you construct a dedicated worker from a string or a `Uint8Array`, but even then it seems rather fishy given that `postMessage()` is supposed to schedule (and might well be contending for priority with tasks the worker itself created).",
